Reserve As Work 5,100
S=Start(5)
Poke S,$FE : Poke S+1,$12 : Poke S+2,$80 : Poke S+3,$7F : Poke S+4,$90 : Poke S+5,1 : Poke S+6,2 : Poke S+7,$FF
Print #1,"Speek 0:";
